WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with a goal. NL-VEIL drives Agent Garrett's MCP tools.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
First: file_analyze. The Worker captures the complete installer in Cloudflare R2 and records its hash.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Next, stored_sample_inspect lists 1,387 archive entries. The evidence points to a Python module: remote_admin.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The next tool call dissects that module: 114 code objects, Telegram configuration, and credential-access commands.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:49.000
A focused call traces the browser extractors, encoded text, and memory buffer into Telegram's document-send arguments. Each result determines the next step.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
These results help defenders detect threats and protect users, accounts, and private information.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Agent Garrett. Protect people.
